# Known, FILED disagreements with the ABI oracle. NOT a suppression list:
# each line is "this IS a finding, and it is that one", with its ticket.
#
# The linter FAILS if an entry here matches nothing -- a stale entry is an
# error, not silence, so this file cannot outlive its cause. When the ticket
# lands, delete the line.
#
# Keyed on <file> TAB <condition text> TAB <ticket>, not on a line number:
# line numbers rot (three site coordinates in the originating ticket were
# stale within four days, while the reasoning held).
